## Troubleshooting

- Ensure all required environment variables are set.
- Verify `BASE_URL` points to a reachable API when required.
- Check API credentials match the authentication scheme in the OpenAPI spec.
- Run `pnpm run build` to verify TypeScript compilation before starting.
